    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>STELLAR DRIFT</u>\u00a0</strong>is a multiplayer, physics based, spaceship building game with roguelike elements. It takes place on &quot;The Drift&quot;. A procedurally generated field in space riddled with precious metals, mining companies, outlaws, and various factions working to assert their dominance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DESIGN AND EQUIP YOUR SHIPS</u></strong> to thrive on The Drift.\u00a0Every active component of your ship can be conveniently mapped to specific keys giving you complete control as the pilot.\u00a0Find hundreds of parts though missions or loot them off of your un-alived enemies. Recruit crew members and synergize your ships parts to overwhelm other factions trying to assert their dominance on the drift.      <br><br><strong><u>ENEMIES AND FACTIONS</u></strong> on the drift are ever evolving. If left unchecked enemies can form groups and upgrade to elite or even boss status. Factions gather recourses and claim regions advantageous for their growth. Strategize when and where to focus your efforts, when to fight or run, and who to befriend or sabotage.\u00a0 \u00a0    </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>STELLAR DRIFT</u>\u00a0</strong>is a multiplayer, physics based, spaceship building game with roguelike elements. It takes place on &quot;The Drift&quot;. A procedurally generated field in space riddled with precious metals, mining companies, outlaws, and various factions working to assert their dominance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DESIGN AND EQUIP YOUR SHIPS</u></strong> to thrive on The Drift.\u00a0Every active component of your ship can be conveniently mapped to specific keys giving you complete control as the pilot.\u00a0Find hundreds of parts though missions or loot them off of your un-alived enemies. Recruit crew members and synergize your ships parts to overwhelm other factions trying to assert their dominance on the drift.      <br><br><strong><u>ENEMIES AND FACTIONS</u></strong> on the drift are ever evolving. If left unchecked enemies can form groups and upgrade to elite or even boss status. Factions gather recourses and claim regions advantageous for their growth. Strategize when and where to focus your efforts, when to fight or run, and who to befriend or sabotage.\u00a0 \u00a0    </p>",
    "short_description": "Carve out a place for yourself in an ever changing\u00a0field of space as you upgrade your bases, and equip your ships to thrive in the mysterious expanse. Dominate &quot;The Drift&quot; solo or with friends as you mine, build, fight, and align with (or sabotage) neighboring factions.",
